        "content": [
          {
            "title": "How is the IIM Visakhapatnam's Senior Management program different?",
            "content": [
              "### Three things that make this program world class:",
              "- **Advanced Pedagogical Approach:** IIM Visakhapatnam's advanced pedagogical approach, supported by its rank of 26th by NIRF, ensures a cutting-edge, innovative, and effective learning experience. This method fosters deep understanding and real-world application of Senior Management concepts.",
